                        "translated_name": "\"Go to the Pharaoh who has become refractory,"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5730,
                        "chapter_id": 79,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "18",
                        "arabic_name": "فَقُلْ هَل لَّكَ إِلَىٰٓ أَن تَزَكَّىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "And say: 'Would you like to grow (in virtue)?"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5731,
                        "chapter_id": 79,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "19",
                        "arabic_name": "وَأَهْدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخْشَىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "Then I will guide you to your Lord that you may come to fear Him.'\""
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5732,
                        "chapter_id": 79,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "20",
                        "arabic_name": "فَأَرَىٰهُ ٱلْـَٔايَةَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "So he showed him the greater sign;"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5733,
                        "chapter_id": 79,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "21",
                        "arabic_name": "فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "But (the Pharaoh) disavowed and disobeyed."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": 5734,
                        "chapter_id": 79,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "22",
                        "arabic_name": "ثُمَّ أَدْبَرَ يَسْعَىٰ",
                        "translated_name": "Then he turned away, deliberating,"
